  "notable_quotes": [
    "The MOF contains narrow microporous channels of 3.5 × 4.0 Å along a, cross-linked by 3.9 × 2.1 Å channels and 3.0 × 1.6 Å slit windows.",
    "The Zn aminotriazolato-oxalate framework shows rapid CO2 uptake at low pressure and a high enthalpy of adsorption, consistent with amine-lined micropores.",
    "Aminotriazolate binds Zn through the three ring nitrogens, while free amino groups protrude into the pores in a zig-zag arrangement."
